e 可以用于:\n>\n> * 集群级别的资源控制( 例如 node 访问权限 )\n> * 非资源型 endpoints( 例如 /health 访问 )\n> * 所有命名空间资源控制(例如 pods )"},"2137":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-927","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#role-and-clusterrole","content":"⚠️ 集群角色不能写命名空间"},"2138":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-928","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#rolebinding-and-clusterrolebinding","content":"> RoleBinding and ClusterRoleBinding是什么？\n> RoleBinding可以将角色中定义的权限授予用户或用户组，RoleBinding 包含一组权限列表(subjects)\n> 权限列表中包含有不同形式的待授予权限资源类型(users, groups, or service accounts)；RoleBinding同样包含对被Bind的Role\n> 引用；RoleBinding 适用于某个命名空间内授权，而 ClusterRoleBinding 适用于集群范围内的授权"},"2139":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-929","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#rolebinding-and-clusterrolebinding","content":"RoleBinding绑定Role"},"2140":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-930","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#rolebinding-and-clusterrolebinding","content":"> 角色通过角色绑定，绑定给用户（user/group/sa）\n> 例如：将 default 命名空间的 pod-reader Role 授予 jane 用户，此后 jane 用户在 default 命名空间中将具有 pod-reader 的权限"},"2141":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-931","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#rolebinding-and-clusterrolebinding","content":"RoleBinding绑定ClusterRole"},"2142":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-932","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#rolebinding-and-clusterrolebinding","content":"> * 集群角色通过集群角色绑定，绑定给用户（user/group/sa）\n> * 同样可以引用ClusterRole来对当前namespace内用户、用户组或ServiceAccount进行授权，这种操作允许集群管理员在整个集群内定义一些通用的ClusterRole，然后在不同的namespace中使用\n>   `RoleBinding`来引用\n> * 例如：以下 `RoleBinding` 引用了一个 ClusterRole，这个 ClusterRole 具有整个集群内对 secrets 的访问权限；但是其授权用户dave只能访问\n>   development 空间中的 secrets(因为 `RoleBinding` 定义在 development 命名空间)"},"2143":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-933","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#rolebinding-and-clusterrolebinding","content":"ClusterRoleBinding绑定ClusterRole"},"2144":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-934","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#rolebinding-and-clusterrolebinding","content":"> * 集群角色通过角色绑定，绑定给用户（user/group/sa）。将集群角色权限限制在角色命名空间下\n> * 使用ClusterRoleBinding可以对整个集群中的所有命名空间资源权限进行授权；以下ClusterRoleBinding样例展示了授权manager组内所有用户在全部命名空间中对secrets进行访问"},"2145":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-935","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#resources子资源","content":"> Kubernetes 集群内一些资源一般以其名称字符串来表示，这些字符串一般会在 API 的 URL 地址中出现；同时某些资源也会包含子资源，例如\n> logs 资源就属于 pods 的子资源，API 中 URL 样例如下"},"2146":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-936","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#resources子资源","content":"> 例如：如果要在 RBAC 授权模型中控制这些子资源的访问权限，可以通过 / 分隔符来实现，以下是一个定义 pods 子资源 logs 访问权限的\n> Role 定义样例"},"2147":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-937","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#to-subjects","content":"> 权限主体：user、group、sa\n> 权限主体命名方式\n> RoleBinding 和 ClusterRoleBinding 可以将 Role 绑定到 Subjects；Subjects 可以是 groups、users 或者 service accounts"},"2148":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-938","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#to-subjects","content":"Subjects 中 Users 使用字符串表示，"},"2149":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-939","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes#to-subjects","content":"它可以是一个普通的名字字符串，如 “alice”；"},"2150":{"id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes-940","page_id":"/docs/kubernetes/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","