est/deployment/offline#离线升级说明","content":"先执行 `upgrade-sql/v1.5.7_to_v1.5.8.sql`，再替换 v1.5.10 前后端镜像"},"3158":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline-66","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline#离线升级说明","content":"v1.5.6"},"3159":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline-67","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline#离线升级说明","content":"先执行 `upgrade-sql/v1.5.7_to_v1.5.8.sql`，再替换 v1.5.10 前后端镜像"},"3160":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline-68","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline#离线升级说明","content":"v1.5.5"},"3161":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline-69","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline#离线升级说明","content":"先执行 `upgrade-sql/v1.5.7_to_v1.5.8.sql`，再替换 v1.5.10 前后端镜像"},"3162":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline-70","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline#离线升级说明","content":"v1.5.4"},"3163":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline-71","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline#离线升级说明","content":"先执行 `upgrade-sql/v1.5.4_to_v1.5.5.sql`，再执行 `upgrade-sql/v1.5.7_to_v1.5.8.sql`，最后替换 v1.5.10 前后端镜像"},"3164":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline-72","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline#离线升级说明","content":"更早开发环境"},"3165":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline-73","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline#离线升级说明","content":"建议导出业务资源，在全新 v1.5.10 环境中导入"},"3166":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline-74","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/offline#离线升级说明","content":"v1.5.8 到 v1.5.10 不需要新增升级 SQL。已有 v1.5.5、v1.5.6 或 v1.5.7 环境升级到