quirements-57","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#网络和端口","content":"部署前建议在目标服务器上确认端口："},"3321":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-58","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#网络和端口","content":"如果端口已被占用，先确认占用进程，再决定是释放端口还是修改 Crest 配置。不要安装完成后再临时换端口，SSO 回调、分享地址和反向代理都可能要跟着改。"},"3322":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-59","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#域名和-https","content":"生产环境建议提前准备："},"3323":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-60","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#域名和-https","content":"固定域名，例如 `https://bi.example.com`。"},"3324":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-61","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#域名和-https","content":"有效 HTTPS 证书。"},"3325":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-62","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#域名和-https","content":"反向代理或 Ingress。"},"3326":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-63","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#域名和-https","content":"Crest 的允许来源配置。"},"3327":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-64","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#域名和-https","content":"SSO 回调地址。"},"3328":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-65","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#域名和-https","content":"如果后续才切换域名，分享链接、SSO 回调和浏览器缓存都可能需要重新检查。"},"3329":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-66","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#域名和-https","content":"如果项目计划对外公开访问，域名和 HTTPS 不要留到最后处理。SSO、分享链接、反向代理、Cookie 和允许来源都依赖最终访问地址。测试阶段可以用 IP，正式交付时应固定到域名。"},"3330":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-67","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#数据库要求","content":"Crest 单机安装默认内置 MySQL。生产环境也可以接入外部 MySQL。"},"3331":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-68","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#数据库要求","content":"外部 MySQL 建议："},"3332":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-69","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#数据库要求","content":"MySQL 8.0 或兼容版本。"},"3333":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-70","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#数据库要求","content":"使用 `utf8mb4` 字符集。"},"3334":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-71","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#数据库要求","content":"提前创建数据库。"},"3335":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-72","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#数据库要求","content":"使用专用账号，不复用 DBA 账号。"},"3336":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-73","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#数据库要求","content":"纳入数据库备份和监控。"},"3337":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-74","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements#数据库要求","content":"如启用 MySQL 数据集缓存，预留缓存表容量和同步任务执行窗口。"},"3338":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements-75","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/requirements","tags":[],"type"