e-management#查看服务状态","content":"查看状态时不能只确认容器存在，还要检查是否持续重启、端口是否映射、启动时间是否异常。容器刚启动成功但应用仍在初始化时，浏览器可能暂时无法访问，需要结合日志判断。"},"3413":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-11","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"v1.5.10 单机部署中，`crest` 是前端 Nginx 网关，`crest-service` 是后端 Spring Boot 服务。页面无法访问时优先查看 `crest`；登录、接口、数据集、导出和权限异常时优先查看 `crest-service`。启用监控后，Prometheus 和 Grafana 日志分别查看："},"3414":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-12","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"排查启动失败时，优先关注："},"3415":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-13","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"关键字"},"3416":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-14","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"可能原因"},"3417":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-15","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"`Flyway`"},"3418":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-16","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"数据库迁移失败"},"3419":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-17","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"`Access denied`"},"3420":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-18","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#查看日志","content":"数据库账号或密码错误"},"3421"