ervice-management#重启服务","content":"重启后检查："},"3430":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-28","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#重启服务","content":"容器是否运行。"},"3431":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-29","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#重启服务","content":"登录页是否可访问。"},"3432":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-30","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#重启服务","content":"管理员是否能登录。"},"3433":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-31","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#重启服务","content":"工作台和系统设置是否正常打开。"},"3434":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-32","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#重启服务","content":"工作台能打开，说明前端资源、后端接口和基础元数据读取基本正常。继续打开数据源、数据集、仪表盘和导出中心，才能确认业务链路恢复。"},"3435":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-33","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#重启服务","content":"如果重启后页面能打开但图表空白，继续检查数据源连接、数据库连接池、后端日志和浏览器网络请求。服务重启成功只是第一步，不能证明业务链路已经完整恢复。"},"3436":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-34","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#备份和恢复","content":"备份文件可能包含数据库内容、上传文件、导出文件和业务配置，应按敏感数据管理。"},"3437":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-35","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#备份和恢复","content":"执行恢复前，应先确认恢复目标、备份时间和影响范围。恢复完成后，必须验证登录、权限、数据源、数据集、仪表盘、大屏、分享和导出，而不是只看命令执行成功。"},"3438":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-36","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#备份和恢复","content":"恢复后打开导出中心，确认历史任务状态和新导出任务都正常。导出文件涉及运行目录和文件权限，是恢复检查中容易遗漏的一环。"},"3439":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management-37","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/service-management#停机窗口","content":"升级、迁移数据库、恢复备份和调整密钥前，应安排停机窗口。停机窗口内建议禁止用户继续创建资源、导出文件或修改权限，避免状态不一致。"},"3440":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node","type":"page","content":"单机在线安装","breadcrumbs":["技术文档","Crest","安装部署"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node"},"3441":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node-0","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node","content":"使用 installer/install.sh 在线安装 Crest，并理解关键配置和安装结果。"},"3442":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node-1","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node#安装目录","content":"安装目录"},"3443":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node-2","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node#修改安装配置","content":"修改安装配置"},"3444":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node-3","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node#执行安装","content":"执行安装"},"3445":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node-4","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node#读取配置","content":"读取配置"},"3446":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node-5","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node#初始化目录","content":"初始化目录"},"3447":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/single-node-6","page