TTPS 问题。"},"4073":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-9","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#问题分类","content":"菜单不可见、资源不可见、角色授权和账号生命周期问题。"},"4074":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-10","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#问题分类","content":"数据源、数据集、图表、仪表盘、大屏和导出问题。"},"4075":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-11","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#问题分类","content":"单点登录、回调地址、Ingress、Pod 状态和集群部署问题。"},"4076":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-12","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#排查基本顺序","content":"这个顺序适合大多数问题。先确认现象和影响范围，是为了避免把单个用户的权限问题误判成系统故障；先记录时间，是为了在审计日志和应用日志中快速定位；最后用普通账号验证，是为了避免管理员账号验证通过但业务用户仍然不可用。"},"4077":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-13","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"信息"},"4078":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-14","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"示例"},"4079":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-15","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"环境"},"4080":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-16","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"单机、离线、Kubernetes、外部 MySQL"},"4081":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-17","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"版本"},"4082":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-18","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"Crest 版本号、部署时间"},"4083":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-19","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"用户"},"4084":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-20","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"发生问题的账号和角色"},"4085":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-21","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"页面"},"4086":{"id":"/doc