text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"这通常是功能权限或资源操作权限不足。处理方法："},"4289":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-46","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"确认该用户是否具备资源编辑职责。"},"4290":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-47","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"检查角色是否有编辑功能权限。"},"4291":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-48","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"检查资源是否授权编辑而不只是查看。"},"4292":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-49","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"确认资源是否被其他用户锁定或正在编辑。"},"4293":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-50","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"使用普通测试账号验证按钮是否出现。"},"4294":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-51","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"v1.5.6 起，只读可见资源不会展示复制、移动、重命名和删除等管理入口。若用户需要复制或维护仪表盘、大屏，应授予资源管理权限，而不是只授予查看权限。"},"4295":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-52","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"公开分享链接属于只读访问链路。当前版本中，即使用户已经登录后台，访问 `/link/:uuid` 也会按分享页策略打开；后台工作台、数据源、数据集等管理路径仍按菜单权限和功能权限校验。排查权限问题时，不要把分享页能访问误判为后台资源权限已开放。"},"4296":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-53","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#管理员权限过度集中","content":"管理员权限应按职责拆分，不建议所有管理员都拥有完整系统管理权限。"},"4297":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-54","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#管理员权限过度集中","content":"建议拆分："},"4298":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-55","p