shboard#第二步添加指标卡","content":"百分比"},"5485":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-255","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第二步添加指标卡","content":"创建时先添加一张指标卡，配置好标题、单位和字号后复制三份，再分别替换指标字段。这样能保证四张卡的样式一致。"},"5486":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-256","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第二步添加指标卡","content":"指标卡验收时，不只看数字是否出现，还要确认标题是否包含范围。例如“销售额”不如“本月销售额”清楚；“完成率”不如“本月需求完成率”清楚。"},"5487":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-257","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第二步添加指标卡","content":"可按以下步骤操作："},"5488":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-258","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#添加第一张指标卡","content":"从图表面板选择指标卡，放到页面第一行左侧。选择经营数据集，把“销售额”或自己的核心指标拖到指标位置。"},"5489":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-259","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#设置标题和单位","content":"标题写成“本月销售额”或“本月交付需求数”。金额统一万元或元，数量统一整数。"},"5490":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-260","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#复制组件","content":"复制三份指标卡，横向排列，保持相同高度和间距。"},"5491":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-261","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#替换字段","content":"分别把指标换成订单数、客单价、毛利率，或替换成需求数、完成率、平均周期、风险数。"},"5492":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-262","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览核对","content":"保存并预览，确认筛选条件改变后四张指标卡都同步变化。"},"5493":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-263","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"趋势图回答“最近是否变好”。示例配置如下："},"5494":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-264","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"配置项"},"5495":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-265","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"示例字段（可替换）"},"5496":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-266","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"图表类型"},"5497":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-267","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"折线图"},"5498":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-268","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"X 轴"},"5499":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-269","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"日期"},"5500":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-270","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"Y 轴"},"5501":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-271","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"销售额、订单数"},"5502":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-272","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"排序"},"5503":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-273","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"日期升序"},"5504":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-274","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"过滤"},"5505":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-275","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"最近 30 天或本月"},"5506":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-276","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"配置完成后检查两件事：日期是否连续，指标单位是否一致。如果销售额和订单数差异很大，建议拆成两张图，或者使用双轴图并明确左右轴单位。"},"5507":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-277","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"趋势图建议保留横轴日期和悬浮提示。标签过密时不宜全部显示，否则页面可读性会下降。业务汇报中，趋势图标题要写清统计周期，例如“近 30 天销售额趋势”。"},"5508":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-278","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第三步添加趋势图","content":"配置趋势图时，日期字段是常见出错点。日期如果被识别成文本，就会按字符串排序，`2026-10` 可能排在 `2026-2` 前面。遇到这种情况，回到数据集把字段类型改成日期，或者在 SQL 中转换日期。"},"5509":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-279","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"排行图用于定位贡献最高或风险最高的对象；明细表用于进一步追溯。"},"5510":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-280","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"图表"},"5511":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-281","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"示例字段（可替换）"},"5512":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-282","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"配置重点"},"5513":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-283","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"