uide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"门店、区域、销售额、订单数、毛利率"},"5524":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-294","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"列宽、排序、导出权限"},"5525":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-295","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"表格不宜放置过多列。正式页面中，表格的价值是追溯问题，而不是把数据库整张表搬进仪表盘。"},"5526":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-296","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"明细表放在页面底部更合适。用户先看指标和趋势，发现异常后再下拉查看明细。表格如果允许导出，发布前要确认列权限和导出权限。"},"5527":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-297","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第四步添加排行图和明细表","content":"表格建议只保留能帮助定位问题的列。例如经营页面保留区域、门店、负责人、销售额、订单数、毛利率；项目页面保留项目、需求编号、阶段、负责人、在库天数、优先级。不应把数据库中的所有字段都放进表格。"},"5528":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-298","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#第五步添加查询组件","content":"顶部查询组件建议先做日期和业务范围："},"5529":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-299","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#添加日期筛选","content":"放在页面顶部，默认值可以设置为本月或最近 30 天。"},"5530":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-300","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#添加区域筛选","content":"使用下拉或搜索组件，绑定区域字段。"},"5531":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-301","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#绑定目标图表-1","content":"日期筛选通常绑定全部图表；区域筛选绑定趋势图、排行图和明细表。"},"5532":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-302","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证-1","content":"保存后进入预览，切换日期和区域，确认所有目标图表都同步变化。"},"5533":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-303","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证-1","content":"如果多个图表来自不同数据集，字段名称可以不同，但业务含义必须一致。例如一个数据集叫“区域”，另一个叫“销售大区”，只要口径一致就可以映射。"},"5534":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-304","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证-1","content":"查询组件验收可按固定步骤执行：保存后进入预览，先记录一个指标卡数值，再切换筛选条件。如果目标图表没有变化，回到编辑器检查目标组件、筛选字段和默认值。"},"5535":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-305","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证-1","content":"这张图可对照“添加筛选器”的入口。日期、下拉、文本搜索、数字区间都属于查询组件。添加后必须绑定目标图表和字段；如果只把组件放到页面上，用户点击它不会影响任何图表。"},"5536":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-306","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证-1","content":"示例：日期筛选绑定所有图表的“日期”字段，区域筛选绑定所有图表的“区域”字段。若某张图来自另一个数据集，也要为它单独映射字段。"},"5537":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-307","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"样式配置用于改善阅读体验，不用于修改业务口径。"},"5538":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-308","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"常用配置："},"5539":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-309","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"配置"},"5540":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-310","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#样式配置","content":"建议"},"5541":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-311","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboar