cs/crest/user-guide/dataset#预览同步和变更","content":"字段结构清晰，维度和指标分类正确。"},"5907":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-256","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#预览同步和变更","content":"关键指标抽样核对过。"},"5908":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-257","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#预览同步和变更","content":"字段名称没有数据库缩写。"},"5909":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-258","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#预览同步和变更","content":"计算字段和分组字段能返回正确结果。"},"5910":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-259","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#预览同步和变更","content":"权限范围符合使用对象。"},"5911":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-260","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#预览同步和变更","content":"如果开启缓存，同步时间和业务刷新频率一致。"},"5912":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-261","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#预览同步和变更","content":"源表字段变化后，数据集可能需要同步。常见变化包括新增字段、删除字段、字段改名、字段类型变化。同步后要检查下游图表是否仍能正常显示。"},"5913":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-262","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#预览同步和变更","content":"数据集中已经被图表使用的字段，不应直接删除或改名。先查下游资源，再与页面负责人确认替代字段。"},"5914":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-263","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"默认情况下，数据集可以采用直连方式读取源库。直连适合数据量较小、查询压力可控、源库稳定的场景。对于查询较重、源库不适合频繁访问，或需要固定刷新窗口的数据集，可以启用缓存，让 Crest 先把数据同步到缓存表，再由图表读取缓存结果。"},"5915":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-264","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"当前版本中，MySQL 数据源支持数据集缓存。基于 MySQL 创建的数据集可选择直连读取或缓存读取；仪表盘和数据大屏通过该数据集取数时，也可读取缓存结果。"},"5916":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-265","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"缓存设置位于数据集编辑器左侧。图中“直连/缓存”决定查询路径，“增量/全量”决定每次更新的范围，“手动/定时”决定更新触发方式。设置完成后不能只保存，还要点击“立即更新”或等待定时任务执行，并检查状态。"},"5917":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-266","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"这张图要按从上到下的顺序看：先决定直连还是缓存，再决定全量还是增量，最后决定手动还是定时。只设置“定时”但未完成首次同步时，仪表盘仍然无法读取缓存数据。"},"5918":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-267","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"当前版本的缓存能力面向 MySQL 数据源数据集。看不到“缓存”选项时，先确认数据源类型、部署版本、系统配置和当前账号权限。"},"5919":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-268","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"缓存区域常用配置如下："},"5920":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-269","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"配置项"},"5921":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-270","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"说明"},"5922":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-271","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"建议"},"5923":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-272","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"读取方式"},"5924":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-273","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#缓存更新和定时任务","content":"选择直连或缓存"},"5925":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-274","page_id":"/d