nt":"创建 API 数据源后，需要在数据源内添加 API 表。每个 API 表可以理解为一个可被数据集使用的接口结果。"},"6211":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-150","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"添加 API 表时，重点是把接口返回结果整理成“表”。如果接口返回的是嵌套 JSON，要明确取哪一层作为数据行、哪些字段作为列。保存前使用测试请求检查返回结果，不应只凭接口文档配置。"},"6212":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-151","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"例如接口返回："},"6213":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-152","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"这时通常要把 `data.records` 作为数据行，把 `project`、`stage`、`count` 作为字段。不应把整个 `data` 对象作为一个字段，否则图表只能看到一段 JSON 文本，无法按项目或阶段统计。"},"6214":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-153","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"当前版本已包含 API 数据源 JsonPath 解析修复。启用 JsonPath 后，系统会按指定节点解析行数据，而不是继续按完整响应推断结构。例如接口返回数据在 `$data.dataList` 下时，应把该路径配置为数据行位置，再从子节点中选择字段。启用 JsonPath 后，字段选择仍保持可编辑，便于补充字段名称、类型和业务说明。"},"6215":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-154","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"常见 JsonPath 配置示例："},"6216":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-155","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"返回结构"},"6217":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-156","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"行数据路径"},"6218":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-157","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#创建-api-数据源","content":"字段配置"},"6219