rce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"打开目标表后，先检查字段，再做数据预览。"},"6258":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-197","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"表预览用于做第一轮数据验收。预览阶段至少要检查字段类型、日期格式、金额单位、空值、乱码和样例行。如果源数据在预览阶段已经异常，后续数据集、图表和大屏都会受到影响。"},"6259":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-198","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"保存后至少检查这些内容："},"6260":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-199","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"目标表或视图是否能看到。"},"6261":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-200","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"字段名称、字段类型和注释是否完整。"},"6262":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-201","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"日期、金额、数量等关键字段是否识别正确。"},"6263":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-202","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"数据预览是否能返回结果。"},"6264":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-203","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"预览数据的时间范围是否符合预期。"},"6265":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-204","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"是否存在明显空值、乱码、权限屏蔽字段。"},"6266":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource-205","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/datasource#查看表和字段","content":"表能看到但预览失败，常见原因是账号没有查询权限、字段类型