/user-guide/portal-53","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal#收藏和最近使用","content":"最近使用由系统自动记录。用户打开已授权的仪表盘或数据大屏后，该资源会进入最近使用列表，便于下次快速返回。"},"6902":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal-54","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal#收藏和最近使用","content":"资源被删除、取消发布或回收权限后，收藏和最近使用中的入口可能失效。遇到这种情况，应先在全部资源中搜索名称；仍找不到时，联系管理员检查资源状态和授权范围。"},"6903":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal-55","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal#搜索和筛选","content":"资源较多时，建议先使用关键字搜索，再配合资源类型筛选。"},"6904":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal-56","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal#搜索和筛选","content":"查找目标"},"6905":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal-57","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal#搜索和筛选","content":"建议操作"},"6906":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal-58","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal#搜索和筛选","content":"知道资源名称"},"6907":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal-59","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal#搜索和筛选","content":"直接输入名称关键字"},"6908":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal-60","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal#搜索和筛选","content":"只看大屏"},"6909":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal-61","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal#搜索和筛选","content":"类型选择“数据大屏”"},"6910":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal-62","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal#搜索和筛选","content":"只看分析页面"},"6911":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal-63","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal","tags":[],"ty