nt":"先回滚最近一次修改，再排查日志"},"8303":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-25","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"入口：系统管理 → 站点设置。"},"8304":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-26","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"站点设置页用于调整系统名称、Logo、浏览器标题等品牌信息。公开交付前，管理员应在登录页、工作台、分享页和浏览器标签页分别检查一次，避免只改了后台配置但前台展示仍是旧名称。"},"8305":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-27","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"站点设置常用于公开交付前统一品牌展示。"},"8306":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-28","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"截图里的配置项一般不会影响数据计算，但会影响用户对系统的识别。公开项目尤其要注意名称、Logo 和浏览器标题一致：用户从登录页进入、从浏览器标签切换、从分享链接打开时，看到的应该是同一个产品或项目名称。"},"8307":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-29","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"建议检查："},"8308":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-30","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"登录页名称是否规范。"},"8309":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-31","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"浏览器标题是否符合项目要求。"},"8310":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-32","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"Logo 是否清晰。"},"8311":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-33","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"页面底部或版权信息是否符合企业规范。"},"8312":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-34","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#站点设置","content":"分享页面是否也展示正确。"},"8313":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-35","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#字体管理","content":"入口：系统管理 → 字体管理。"},"8314":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-36","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#字体管理","content":"字体管理页影响仪表盘、大屏和导出效果。上传字体后，不能说明所有页面会自动使用该字体；需要在对应仪表盘或大屏编辑器中选择并保存。对外项目还要确认字体授权范围。"},"8315":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-37","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#字体管理","content":"字体管理常用于数据大屏交付。上传字体前应确认授权范围，尤其是对外展示、商用项目和客户交付环境。"},"8316":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-38","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#字体管理","content":"字体上传后建议用一张正式大屏做验证，而不是只看字体列表是否出现。因为字体真正生效的位置在编辑器和渲染结果中，特别是中文标题、数字指标、导出图片和投屏环境。对外项目要避免使用没有授权的商业字体。"},"8317":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-39","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#字体管理","content":"操作流程："},"8318":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-40","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#准备字体","content":"确认字体文件来源、授权范围和格式。"},"8319":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-41","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#上传字体","content":"在字体管理页面上传字体文件，名称保持简洁可识别。"},"8320":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-42","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#应用到资源","content":"在仪表盘或大屏编辑器中选择字体，保存并预览。"},"8321":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-43","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#导出验证","content":"使用图片、PDF 或预览功能检查字体是否生效。"},"8322":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-44","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"场景"},"8323":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-45","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"建议"},"8324":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-46","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"客户交付"},"8325":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-47","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"统一 Logo、标题、字体和版权"},"8326":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-48","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"多环境部署"},"8327":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-49","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"测试、预发、生产保持配置差异可追踪"},"8328":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-50","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"字体过多"},"8329":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-51","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"清理未使用字体，避免编辑器选择混乱"},"8330":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-52","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"参数变更频繁"},"8331":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-53","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"建立配置变更审批和记录"},"8332":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-54","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"页面展示异常"},"8333":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-55","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#管理建议","content":"先排查站点配置、字体资源和浏览器缓存"},"8334":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-56","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"登录页截图是否符合项目形象。"},"8335":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-57","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"工作台名称和 Logo 是否正确。"},"8336":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-58","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"仪表盘和大屏是否使用统一字体。"},"8337":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-59","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"分享页面是否有正确品牌信息。"},"8338":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-si